---
import ApertureMark from './ApertureMark.astro';
import { club, nav } from '../data/club';
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---
<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="wrap grid">
    <div class="about">
      <a class="brand" href="/">
        <ApertureMark size={34} />
        <span>
          <span class="brand-en">{club.name.toUpperCase()}</span>
          <span class="brand-ja">{club.nameJa}</span>
        </span>
      </a>
      <p class="small muted">
        写真を通して「楽しむ」と「つながる」を大切にするサークルです。国籍・学年・経験は問いません。スマホで撮る人も大歓迎。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <p class="edge">MEETING</p>
      <p class="small">
        {club.meetings.day} {club.meetings.times.join(' / ')}<br />
        {club.campus} {club.meetings.room} 教室
      </p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <p class="edge">CONTACT</p>
      <ul class="links small">
        <li><a href={club.instagram.url} rel="noopener" target="_blank">Instagram @{club.instagram.handle}</a></li>
        <li><span class="num select">{club.email}</span></li>
        <li><a href="/join/">見学・入部の申し込み</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div>
      <p class="edge">PAGES</p>
      <ul class="links small">
        {nav.map((item) => <li><a href={item.href}>{item.ja}</a></li>)}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="wrap base">
    <p class="edge">KUAS 400 ▸ © {year} {club.name}</p>
    <p class="small muted">
      写真の著作権は撮影者にあります。無断転載はご遠慮ください。
      <a href={club.github} rel="noopener" target="_blank">このサイトのソース</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .site-footer {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    background: var(--rebate);
    padding-block: 56px 32px;
    display: grid;
    gap: 40px;
  }

  .grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.6fr 1fr 1.2fr 1fr;
    gap: 32px 40px;
  }

  .grid > div {
    display: grid;
    gap: 10px;
    align-content: start;
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .brand {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .brand :global(svg) {
    color: var(--amber);
    flex: none;
  }

  .brand > span {
    display: grid;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .brand-en {
    font: 500 12px/1.3 var(--mono);
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
  }

  .brand-ja {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .about p {
    max-width: 28em;
  }

  .links {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: 6px;
  }

  .select {
    user-select: all;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }

  .base {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 8px 24px;
    padding-top: 24px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    }

    .about {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
